'''Coins''' are an in-game currency specifically for ''[[Free Realms]]''. They can be used to purchase items from the [[Coin Shop]], and [[Farms|farming]]. Unlike [[Station Cash]], coins do not cost real currency to obtain, although it is available to spend [[Station Cash|SC]] to purchase coins in the [[Station Cash Marketplace|SC Marketplace]].

You can earn coins by doing random [[Quests|quests]] and [[Dungeons|dungeons]] throughout the game.
